{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Surely in a son of man do not trust</b> — for they are vanity and deceit. And these ascend on the scales: sons of man, and sons of men — their being lighter than vanity, by way of parable, for they are vanity of vanities, according to the words of Solomon."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 62, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:31.967400892Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}